{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"局部积闭范畴"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"LCCC"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>局部积闭范畴是"},{"Local":{"url":"依值类型论","text":"依值类型论"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴语义","text":"语义"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p><strong>局部积闭范畴</strong> (locally Cartesian closed category, LCCC) $\\mathcal C$ 是满足所有"},{"Local":{"url":"俯范畴","text":"俯范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C_{/X}$ 均为"},{"Local":{"url":"积闭范畴","text":"积闭范畴"}},{"Plain":"的范畴. 通常我们要求 $\\mathcal C$ 有"},{"Local":{"url":"终对象","text":"终对象"}},{"Plain":" $1$, 从而 $\\mathcal C \\simeq\\mathcal C_{/1}$ 本身也是"},{"Local":{"url":"积闭范畴","text":"积闭范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>依值积</h3>\n<p>对于局部积闭范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 中的态射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$, 俯范畴的拉回 $f^* \\colon \\mathcal C_{/Y} \\to \\mathcal C_{X}$ 同时有左伴随 $\\Sigma_f$ 与右伴随 $\\Pi_f$, 它们分别是"},{"Local":{"url":"依值和","text":"依值和"}},{"Plain":"与"},{"Local":{"url":"依值积","text":"依值积"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"语法–语义对偶","text":"语义"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"是局部积闭范畴.</p>\n"}]}}